{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10291170","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10291170","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1029117001:2":{"text":"눈을 계속 감고 있는데, 혹시 눈이 안 보이는 건가요? 그런데 어떻게 알고 몬스터를 정확하게 물리칠 수 있는 거죠?","source_cn":"你的眼睛一直闭着，是看不到吗？你竟然还准确地清除了魔物？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD51B7B55AB2A55A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029117002:1":{"text":"난 시력을, 잃지 않았으니... 걱정하지 마라.","source_cn":"看到？我并未失明，放心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA44871A923FE6D4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029117003:1":{"text":"말을 참 이상하고 느리게 하네요... 뭐, 상관없어요. 조금 전에 당신이 도와주지 않았더라도 셀리오스님께서 저를 도와주셨을 거예요!","source_cn":"你说话怎么又慢又怪的……无所谓，就算你刚刚没有出手，赛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8D39E6ACD6D9C79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029117004:1":{"text":"“셀리오스”님이... 누구지?","source_cn":"“赛利欧斯”大人……是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9399E40A32F2769","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029117005:1":{"text":"왜 이렇게 둔하신 거죠? 멋진 이름만 들어도 셀리오스 님이 악마라는 걸 알 수 있지 않나요?","source_cn":"你怎么这么迟钝。听这个帅气的名字叫就知道，赛利欧斯大人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F3FC379C585174C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029117006:1":{"text":"악마...? 난 들어본 적이 없구나.","source_cn":"恶魔……？我不曾听过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC56135D720F08804","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029117007:1":{"text":"흥흥, 당연히 못 들어봤겠죠. 죄다 거짓... 아니, 저도 계시를 받아 알게 된 거예요!","source_cn":"哼哼，你当然没听过，因为是他们瞎编——不对，是我接收到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x450498353C759220","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029117008:1":{"text":"악마는… 인간에게 계시를 내리지 않아.","source_cn":"恶魔……不会给予人类指引。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB038997E4686ED3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029117009:1":{"text":"무, 무슨 소리예요! 악마도 당연히 계시를 내리죠. 내가 그쪽보다 악마는 더 잘 알거든요!","source_cn":"你、你乱说什么呢！恶魔就是会这样的，我肯定比你更懂恶魔好吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1ADE00B7196A1E6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1029117010:1":{"text":"저기, 잠시만요. 반신 스칼리타님이 왜 여기 계시는 거예요?","source_cn":"那个，打断一下。半神斯克嘉莉德大人，您为何在此处？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA94F918CAF909A72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1029117011:1":{"text":"난, 그저 지나가던 중에 몬스터가 이 아이를 공격하는 것을 보고 몬스터를 물리친 것뿐이다...","source_cn":"我，并非特意来到此处，路过而已。魔物攻击她，必须消灭——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8764B2F99EAC9909","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1029117012:1":{"text":"그렇군요. 이 여자아이가 바로 저희가 찾고 있던 그 도라예요!","source_cn":"原来如此，这个小女孩是朵拉，我们就是来寻找她的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF278C3FC3312AE17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1029117013:1":{"text":"마침 잘 되었군. 이곳은 위험해. 도라, 악마는 사람을 유혹할 뿐, 계시는 내리지 않으니 조심하도록. 그럼, 또 보자고.","source_cn":"如此甚好，此地危险。朵拉，恶魔从不指引人类，唯有诱惑，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1313EF67A729A749","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:朵拉":{"text":"도라","source":"朵拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:斯克嘉莉德":{"text":"스칼리타","source":"斯克嘉莉德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":3}}